{"id":"n5_u05_l4","unit_id":"n5_u05","instructional_level":"N5","title":"Loanword sounds: ティ ファ チェ","goal":"Read the extra katakana made for sounds borrowed from other languages.","introduces":{"kana":["ka_k_ti","ka_k_tu","ka_k_di","ka_k_du","ka_k_fa","ka_k_fi","ka_k_fe","ka_k_fo","ka_k_wi","ka_k_we","ka_k_wo_2","ka_k_she","ka_k_je","ka_k_che"],"vocab":["v_tii","v_paatii","v_fooku","v_fairu","v_firumu","v_chekku","v_shea","v_webu","v_disuku"]},"explain":[{"heading":"A small vowel changes the sound","body":["Katakana adds small vowels to make sounds Japanese lacks: ティ (ti), ファ (fa), フィ (fi), フォ (fo), チェ (che), シェ (she), ウィ (wi).","You will mostly see them in loanwords: ティー (tea), パーティー (party), フォーク (fork)."],"examples":[{"ja":"パーティー","reading":"paatii","en":"party"},{"ja":"フォーク","reading":"fooku","en":"fork"},{"ja":"チェック","reading":"chekku","en":"check"}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u05_ex01","q_n5u05_ex02","q_n5u05_ex03","q_n5u05_ex04","q_n5u05_ex05","q_n5u05_ex06","q_n5u05_ex07","q_n5u05_ex08","q_n5u05_mt08","q_n5u05_rd11","q_n5u05_rd12","q_n5u05_vm_tii","q_n5u05_vm_paatii","q_n5u05_vm_fooku","q_n5u05_vm_fairu","q_n5u05_vm_firumu","q_n5u05_vm_chekku","q_n5u05_vm_shea","q_n5u05_vm_webu","q_n5u05_vm_disuku"],"gen":[{"type":"kana_recog","from":"kana","ids":["ka_k_ti","ka_k_tu","ka_k_di","ka_k_du","ka_k_fa","ka_k_fi","ka_k_fe","ka_k_fo","ka_k_wi","ka_k_we","ka_k_wo_2","ka_k_she","ka_k_je","ka_k_che"],"n":6}]},"exit_check":{"gen":[{"type":"kana_recog","from":"kana","ids":["ka_k_ti","ka_k_tu","ka_k_di","ka_k_du","ka_k_fa","ka_k_fi","ka_k_fe","ka_k_fo","ka_k_wi","ka_k_we","ka_k_wo_2","ka_k_she","ka_k_je","ka_k_che"],"n":6},{"type":"vocab_meaning","from":"vocab","ids":["v_tii","v_paatii","v_fooku","v_fairu","v_firumu","v_chekku","v_shea","v_webu","v_disuku"],"n":4}],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u05_l5","unit_id":"n5_u05","instructional_level":"N5","title":"This, that and which","goal":"Point to things with これ・それ・あれ・どれ and この・その・あの・どの.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_kore","v_sore","v_are","v_dore","v_kono","v_sono","v_ano","v_dono","v_onigiri"],"grammar":["g_kore_sore_are","g_kono_sono_ano"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Three distances for things","body":["これ is near me, それ is near you, あれ is over there. どれ asks \"which one?\". Use them alone: これ は ほん です.","Before a noun use この・その・あの・どの: この ケーキ, あの ひと."],"examples":[{"ja":"これ は なん です か","reading":"kore wa nan desu ka","en":"What is this?"},{"ja":"この ケーキ は おいしい です","reading":"kono keeki wa oishii desu","en":"This cake is delicious."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u05_ga01","q_n5u05_ga02","q_n5u05_ga03","q_n5u05_ga04","q_n5u05_ga05","q_n5u05_ga06","q_n5u05_ga07","q_n5u05_gb01","q_n5u05_gb02","q_n5u05_gb03","q_n5u05_ty01","q_n5u05_ty02","q_n5u05_ty03","q_n5u05_vm_kore","q_n5u05_vm_sore","q_n5u05_vm_are","q_n5u05_vm_dore","q_n5u05_vm_kono","q_n5u05_vm_sono","q_n5u05_vm_ano","q_n5u05_vm_dono","q_n5u05_vm_onigiri"]},"context":{"question_ids":["q_n5u05_gb04","q_n5u05_gb05","q_n5u05_gb06","q_n5u05_gb07","q_n5u05_ty04"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u05_ga01","q_n5u05_ga02","q_n5u05_ga04","q_n5u05_ga06","q_n5u05_gb01","q_n5u05_gb02","q_n5u05_gb03","q_n5u05_gb05"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u05_l6","unit_id":"n5_u05","instructional_level":"N5","title":"Prices: 七八九十百千 and えん","goal":"Read bigger numbers and say how much something costs.","introduces":{"kanji":["k_shichi","k_hachi","k_kyuu","k_juu","k_hyaku","k_sen"],"vocab":["v_num7","v_num8","v_num9","v_num10","v_num100","v_num1000","v_en","v_ikura","v_sanbyaku","v_roppyaku","v_happyaku","v_sanzen","v_hassen"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Big numbers","body":["十 is ten (a cross), 百 is hundred and 千 is thousand. Before 百 and 千 the sound changes for some numbers: 300 さんびゃく, 600 ろっぴゃく, 800 はっぴゃく, 3,000 さんぜん, 8,000 はっせん.","Prices end in えん (yen): ひゃく えん is 100 yen. To ask the price say これ は いくら です か."],"examples":[{"ja":"十 百 千","reading":"juu hyaku sen","en":"ten, hundred, thousand"},{"ja":"これ は いくら です か","reading":"kore wa ikura desu ka","en":"How much is this?"}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u05_nk01","q_n5u05_nk02","q_n5u05_nk03","q_n5u05_nk04","q_n5u05_nk05","q_n5u05_nk06","q_n5u05_nm01","q_n5u05_nm02","q_n5u05_nm03","q_n5u05_nm04","q_n5u05_nm05","q_n5u05_nm06","q_n5u05_nmt01","q_n5u05_nmt02","q_n5u05_pr01","q_n5u05_pr02","q_n5u05_pr03","q_n5u05_pr04","q_n5u05_pr05","q_n5u05_pr06","q_n5u05_nty01","q_n5u05_nty02","q_n5u05_nty03","q_n5u05_nty04","q_n5u05_nty05","q_n5u05_nty06","q_n5u05_vm_num7","q_n5u05_vm_num8","q_n5u05_vm_num9","q_n5u05_vm_num10","q_n5u05_vm_num100","q_n5u05_vm_num1000","q_n5u05_vm_en","q_n5u05_vm_ikura"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u05_nk01","q_n5u05_nk04","q_n5u05_nk05","q_n5u05_nm02","q_n5u05_nm06","q_n5u05_nmt01","q_n5u05_pr01","q_n5u05_pr02","q_n5u05_pr05","q_n5u05_nty05"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u05_l7","unit_id":"n5_u05","instructional_level":"N5","title":"At the convenience store","goal":"Ask a price, ask for something, and understand the register.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_irasshai","v_kudasai","v_zenbu","v_reji","v_fukuro","v_otsuri"]},"explain":[{"heading":"A short shop conversation","body":["Staff say いらっしゃいませ (\"welcome\"). Point and say これ ください (\"this one, please\"). The staff add the total: ぜんぶで ろっぴゃく えん です.","You may also hear おつり (change) and ふくろ (a bag)."],"examples":[{"ja":"これ ください","reading":"kore kudasai","en":"This one, please."},{"ja":"ぜんぶで ろっぴゃく えん です","reading":"zenbu de roppyaku en desu","en":"That is 600 yen in total."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u05_tr01","q_n5u05_tr02","q_n5u05_tr03","q_n5u05_tr04","q_n5u05_so01","q_n5u05_so02","q_n5u05_so03","q_n5u05_ty05","q_n5u05_ty06","q_n5u05_dg01","q_n5u05_dg02","q_n5u05_dg03","q_n5u05_vm_irasshai","q_n5u05_vm_kudasai","q_n5u05_vm_zenbu","q_n5u05_vm_reji","q_n5u05_vm_fukuro","q_n5u05_vm_otsuri"]},"context":{"question_ids":["q_n5u05_dg04","q_n5u05_dg05","q_n5u05_dg06","q_n5u05_dg07","q_n5u05_dg08","q_n5u05_tr05","q_n5u05_tr06"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u05_dg01","q_n5u05_dg03","q_n5u05_dg05","q_n5u05_dg07","q_n5u05_tr01","q_n5u05_tr02","q_n5u05_so01"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
